  "results": [
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u003",
      "targetTextSha256": "94c035880406e629b6bbf1de446844fe14398c6e859b85029b1a37b00f724b36",
      "audioSha256": "026d67eaec60367f5ff6da4d5e18e0949e9d05bc535564d559bb467f45a145a5",
      "recognized": "强烈的性情是他的核心特质，所以他做任何事都带着一股强烈的劲头。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u004",
      "targetTextSha256": "19d9262d2a491bde30e96b754b915f2d7217ba773d6c77774762b38a476c768a",
      "audioSha256": "0ab0258415920e0c67b7af11b4e85eab875c05e3ed1e522cb5eb01b38991d0aa",
      "recognized": "所以，同样的，神出于他圣洁这一核心属性，所做的一切，在道德上都是完美无缺的。",
      "similarity": 0.969697,
      "differences": [
        {
          "kind": "replace",
          "expected": [
            "地"
          ],
          "recognized": [
            "的"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u005",
      "targetTextSha256": "fc4cc43d9366acad7f7ca98c16490dd975a9b3f4c0bcc8163d5f823d5fdfa2ef",
      "audioSha256": "987fb79323cb1bfc490108f361942e748a8961f464c087c87d33bb47af4c17dd",
      "recognized": "这也就是说，如果神带来这些神圣的警告，他会以怎样的方式来做呢？",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u006",
      "targetTextSha256": "8124efe8153b5476daa3daff075b7597af84f670be7f2f6efdb504ba5182bb21",
      "audioSha256": "90f9a129a41bae8169826240dfaed23e070789b83efa33f61e9f9268af49f7af",
      "recognized": "以道德上完美无缺的方式。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u007",
      "targetTextSha256": "f4c59aa726a484fda5082e4c77f91f2f3fb3bf0b8d9e38cc47f5363749e8344a",
      "audioSha256": "1d7af3fc00ec3f0b5ef08534cd5950bc4acc025935294a5009139b7917d3ec23",
      "recognized": "所以我们来看第八章时，有一点实在令人惊叹：在神的警告，也就是吹号的警告还没有发出之前。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u008",
      "targetTextSha256": "3aed482cdc80c45fd10522d216738714f2ab334b923187996e5ccab6c0f80857",
      "audioSha256": "b62531864604e17bccb16497d9d1ef2d2c0dac0f7e38457c52c3cd5133af4246",
      "recognized": "使徒约翰，也就是本书的作者，首先清楚地表明了神的圣洁。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u009",
      "targetTextSha256": "937ef12d0c8881daff18e8a4c6d1c23614451e60bbeda55c41211eb10bacd80d",
      "audioSha256": "bd81d1c6d05d56a76b559a883650d1e4fa35198895e1b0d26a8297e0e3c12a2f",
      "recognized": "这有两个令人惊叹的地方。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u010",
      "targetTextSha256": "2b6d6d579cf2073ff358f7022364793b30d69e3b3ddbd6ce1223710853a89ed5",
      "audioSha256": "9c43afe2d4f41a82a3cfdf602e9adeada9777f41e873d34b6d0617bfcc51d559",
      "recognized": "第一是借着静默。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u011",
      "targetTextSha256": "a80ee073782390ff342e4fbc4d27a25ae95cdb836f38ed3eefd70682bdf43d84",
      "audioSha256": "c965e3085a09aaaa9022e6aac9396f5f4cc5a3b8ed09d3c4c2c9d05005909120",
      "recognized": "静默。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u012",
      "targetTextSha256": "bf840114764f97fa43e3650663d1ce4154a9aa7f37aa19443571259ffdb08ca1",
      "audioSha256": "c010c111b654fdacb2120d701447485ddf5aab70f403fa4640a6bfe6a549f0ed",
      "recognized": "大家知道，在旧约里，静默常常与神的圣洁联系在一起。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u013",
      "targetTextSha256": "d556d3d74a2d3a921728d7fb29709969196b4084728123b45e6b25842555710a",
      "audioSha256": "502c38b32abc6e277f5b575f0ab2c260ffd21677c7904ac25e183f61e3920d71",
      "recognized": "比如，我们来看《哈巴谷书》第二章。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u014",
      "targetTextSha256": "a965583ca6befe1a32cc7844bd2ef7b72c953eb2f358a3040e776706d8d4c2af",
      "audioSha256": "6187e6acd96b13518d1d17e966ffc5b7b276a5f2de055eddad9c6a08301d8504",
      "recognized": "然而，主在他的圣殿里。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u015",
      "targetTextSha256": "a25b4ee0d067ee8ca7bdd47f9ecfac052391e7cc29ccf944d7f1105ddacc3ccd",
      "audioSha256": "a25e4b674777284cf663d44ac219b38cd6909b342fecb0af88d5e873ba7a9cc4",
      "recognized": "全地都要在他面前保持安静。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u016",
